OL,3,AHousehold energy bills to hit
OL,4,Athree-year high as Ofgem announces 4%
OL,5,Arise from October
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than a third of households are now
OL,8,Fon fixed tariffs so their prices will
OL,9,Fnot change.
